    "analysis": "# TESSERA — Windows Forensics\n\n## Recon\n\n`tessera.zip` berisi pohon filesystem Windows di `evidence/`, bukan capture jaringan. Profil pengguna yang terlihat hampir kosong, jadi saya beralih ke artefak Windows: ETL, hive registry, Prefetch, dan `$MFT`.\n\n```bash\nfile tessera.zip\nfile evidence/Windows/System32/LogFiles/WMI/AuditDiagTrace.etl\nstrings -el evidence/Windows/System32/LogFiles/WMI/AuditDiagTrace.etl | rg 'PORT=|HEX='\n```\n\n`AuditDiagTrace.etl` teridentifikasi sebagai Windows Event Trace Log. `strings` menemukan record dengan endpoint RPC lokal dan payload hex:\n\n```text\nPORT=\\RPC Control\\AepLocalEndpoint_Q8;HEX=6B33292E77777777773233190E1C213B362A39052A6A282E05396A3636352B2F230526260E3B283D3F2E093F282C33393F601E333B3D0E283B3931092C391B2F22\n```\n\nSaya coba XOR satu byte; `0x5a` menghasilkan teks yang koheren:\n\n```text\n1ist-----hiCTF{alpc_p0rt_c0lloquy_||TargetService:DiagTrackSvcAux\n```\n\n`1ist-----` adalah penanda urutan untuk potongan pertama; flag dimulai di `hiCTF{`. `||` memisahkan potongan flag dari nama service yang menjadi petunjuk pivot. Karena endpoint-nya berada di `\\RPC Control`, analisis bergerak ke komunikasi lokal Windows, bukan TCP.\n\n## Service membawa kunci DPAPI\n\nHive `SYSTEM` memiliki service `DiagTrackSvcAux`. Di `Parameters`, dua nilai menentukan artefak berikutnya:\n\n```text\nServiceVault = C:\\Windows\\System32\\config\\systemprofile\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Caches\\cpinforev.dat\nEntropyToken = VGVzc2VyYUVudHJvcHlfOTk=\n```\n\nToken Base64 itu menjadi entropy `TesseraEntropy_99`. `cpinforev.dat` memiliki header DPAPI. Saya ekstrak `DPAPI_SYSTEM` dari hive `SYSTEM` dan `SECURITY`, lalu gunakan machine key bersama entropy tersebut untuk membuka blob:\n\n```bash\nsource /home/nata/ctf_env/bin/activate\nsecretsdump.py -system evidence/Windows/System32/config/SYSTEM \\\n  -security evidence/Windows/System32/config/SECURITY LOCAL\n```\n\nJSON hasil dekripsi memberikan potongan kedua, kunci layer berikutnya, dan locator:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"FlagPart2\": \"--s32nd--s35s10n_z3r0_syst3npr0f1l3_\",\n  \"NextKey\": \"T3ss3r4_K3y_8819472MasterSecret!\",\n  \"TargetLocator\": {\n    \"NodeHex\": \"45544C4C6F63616C53746F7265\",\n    \"Subsystem\": \"%ALLUSERSPROFILE%\\\\Microsoft\\\\Diagnosis\",\n    \"Schema\": \"NTFS_REPARSE_STREAM_LOCATOR\"\n  },\n  \"IV_HEX\": \"101112131415161718191a1b1c1d1e1f\"\n}\n```\n\n`NodeHex` terbaca sebagai `ETLLocalStore`. Folder itu tampak kosong saat dilihat sebagai direktori biasa, jadi saya periksa record-nya langsung di `$MFT`. `--s32nd--` pada `FlagPart2` menandai urutan potongan kedua dan dibuang saat merangkai isi flag.\n\n## Reparse buffer membuka potongan terakhir\n\nRecord `$MFT` untuk `ETLLocalStore` bertanda reparse point (`0xa0000028`) dan menyimpan buffer 48 byte. Mendekripsi buffer dengan AES-256-CBC, `NextKey`, serta IV dari JSON menghasilkan:\n\n```text\niiiiiiiiiii-3hird---r3p4r53_buff3r_vort3x}\n```\n\nSebelas huruf `i` di awal adalah filler. `-3hird---` menandai urutan potongan ketiga dan bukan isi flag; bagian flag ketiga dimulai di `r3p4r53` dan menyediakan penutup `}`. Setelah membuang penanda urutan pada potongan kedua dan ketiga, hasil gabungannya:\n\n```text\nhiCTF{alpc_p0rt_c0lloquy_s35s10n_z3r0_syst3npr0f1l3_r3p4r53_buff3r_vort3x}\n```\n\n## Reproduksi\n\nSolver tersimpan di `solve.py`; kode lengkapnya juga disertakan di bawah. Ia mengulang ekstraksi DPAPI_SYSTEM, membaca entropy dari service, membuka blob DPAPI, mencari record reparse di `$MFT`, lalu mencetak flag. Jalankan setelah mengaktifkan environment di atas. Dependensi Python yang dipakai tersedia di `ctf_env` (`Registry`, `impacket`, `dissect.ntfs`, dan `Crypto`).\n\nCatatan cleanup: `evidence/` dan `tessera.zip` dihapus setelah solver diverifikasi, sesuai permintaan. Untuk menjalankan ulang, pulihkan pohon `evidence/` terlebih dahulu.\n\n```python\nimport base64\nimport json\nimport re\nimport subprocess\n\nfrom Crypto.Cipher import AES\nfrom Crypto.Util.Padding import unpad\nfrom Registry import Registry\nfrom dissect.ntfs.mft import Mft, ATTRIBUTE_TYPE_CODE\nfrom impacket.dpapi import DPAPI_BLOB, MasterKey, MasterKeyFile, bin_to_string\n\nEVIDENCE = \"evidence\"\nSYSTEM = f\"{EVIDENCE}/Windows/System32/config/SYSTEM\"\nSECURITY = f\"{EVIDENCE}/Windows/System32/config/SECURITY\"\nETL = f\"{EVIDENCE}/Windows/System32/LogFiles/WMI/AuditDiagTrace.etl\"\nMFT_PATH = f\"{EVIDENCE}/[SYSTEM]/$MFT\"\n\n# Decode the LPC/ALPC trace payload and take the service name after ||.\netl_text = open(ETL, \"rb\").read().decode(\"utf-16le\", \"ignore\")\nmatch = re.search(r\"PORT=([^;]+);HEX=([0-9A-Fa-f]+)\", etl_text)\ntrace_clear = bytes.fromhex(match.group(2))\ntrace_clear = bytes(byte ^ 0x5A for byte in trace_clear)\nservice = trace_clear.split(b\"TargetService:\", 1)[1].decode(\"ascii\")\npart1 = trace_clear[trace_clear.index(b\"hiCTF{\"):].split(b\"||\", 1)[0]\n\n# Recover the machine DPAPI key from the offline SECURITY/SYSTEM hives.\nsecrets = subprocess.check_output(\n    [\"secretsdump.py\", \"-system\", SYSTEM, \"-security\", SECURITY, \"LOCAL\"],\n    text=True,\n    stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,\n)\nmachine_hex = re.search(r\"dpapi_machinekey:0x([0-9a-fA-F]+)\", secrets).group(1)\nmachine_key = bytes.fromhex(machine_hex)\n\n# Read the service's DPAPI entropy and vault path from SYSTEM.\nregistry = Registry.Registry(SYSTEM)\nparams = registry.open(f\"ControlSet001\\\\Services\\\\{service}\\\\Parameters\")\nentropy = base64.b64decode(params.value(\"EntropyToken\").value())\nvault_win = params.value(\"ServiceVault\").value()\nvault_rel = vault_win.split(\":\", 1)[1].lstrip(\"\\\\\").replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")\nvault_path = f\"{EVIDENCE}/{vault_rel}\"\n\nblob = DPAPI_BLOB(data=open(vault_path, \"rb\").read())\nguid = bin_to_string(blob[\"GuidMasterKey\"]).lower()\nmaster_path = f\"{EVIDENCE}/Windows/System32/Microsoft/Protect/S-1-5-18/{guid}\"\nmaster_raw = open(master_path, \"rb\").read()\nmaster_file = MasterKeyFile(data=master_raw)\nstart = len(master_file)\nmaster_data = master_raw[start:start + master_file[\"MasterKeyLen\"]]\nmaster_key = MasterKey(data=master_data).decrypt(machine_key)\nvault_clear = blob.decrypt(master_key, entropy=entropy)\nvault = json.loads(vault_clear.decode(\"utf-8\"))\n\n# Resolve the locator to the resident reparse-point buffer in the MFT.\nnode = bytes.fromhex(vault[\"TargetLocator\"][\"NodeHex\"]).decode(\"ascii\")\nmft_raw = open(MFT_PATH, \"rb\").read()\noffset = mft_raw.index(node.encode(\"utf-16le\"))\nmft = Mft(open(MFT_PATH, \"rb\"))\nrecord = mft.get(offset // 1024)\nreparse = record.attributes[ATTRIBUTE_TYPE_CODE.REPARSE_POINT][0].data()\nlength = int.from_bytes(reparse[4:6], \"little\")\nciphertext = reparse[8:8 + length]\n\nkey = vault[\"NextKey\"].encode(\"ascii\")\niv = bytes.fromhex(vault[\"IV_HEX\"])\npart3_clear = unpad(AES.new(key, AES.MODE_CBC, iv).decrypt(ciphertext), 16)\nthird_marker = b\"-3hird---\"\nassert part3_clear.startswith(b\"i\" * 11 + third_marker)\npart3 = part3_clear[11 + len(third_marker):]\n\npart2_raw = vault[\"FlagPart2\"].encode(\"ascii\")\nsecond_marker = b\"--s32nd--\"\nassert part2_raw.startswith(second_marker)\npart2 = part2_raw[len(second_marker):]\nprint((part1 + part2 + part3).decode(\"ascii\"))\n```\n",
