    "analysis": "# Whispers in the Margin\n\n## Ringkasan\n\nArsip challenge punya dokumen Word yang menyimpan passphrase menggunakan pola spasi/tab, dan JPEG yang menyimpan `flag.txt` lewat Steghide. Passphrase dipakai untuk membuka JPEG.\n\n## File Challenge\n\nArsip `whispers-in-the-margin.zip` berisi:\n\n- `chall/Those numbers are process counts.docx`\n- `chall/chall.jpg`\n\n## Analisis Awal\n\n- Dokumen Word berbentuk ZIP/OpenXML. Isi `word/document.xml` mengandung 25 paragraf yang sepintas kosong, tetapi menyimpan spasi dan tab.\n- JPEG punya resolusi 5182 × 3455. Tidak ditemukan data archive yang ditempel di akhir JPEG.\n\n## Temuan Penting\n\nPada masing-masing baris tersembunyi, spasi dipetakan ke `0`, tab ke `1`, lalu nilai biner diubah menjadi ASCII. Hasil 25 karakter:\n\n```\nhaha! u got me, now what?\n```\n\nIni passphrase Steghide untuk `chall.jpg`.\n\n## Proses Ekstraksi\n\nPemeriksaan manual terhadap koefisien JPEG dan format Steghide menunjukkan:\n\n- Magic Steghide `0x73688d` cocok saat passphrase digunakan sebagai seed pseudorandom selector.\n- Algorithm ID `2`: Rijndael-128; mode ID `1`: CBC.\n- Panjang plaintext terenkapsulasi `449` bit, menggunakan AES-CBC dengan IV dalam payload.\n- Setelah dekripsi, zlib mengembalikan struktur data berisi nama `flag.txt` dan isi flag.\n- CRC32 (`MHASH_CRC32`) diverifikasi dan **cocok** (`0x0e9f2bee`). Ini bukan varian CRC32B yang biasa dipakai `zlib.crc32`.\n\nMetode ringkas untuk mengekstrak secara manual:\n\n```bash\nsteghide extract -sf chall/chall.jpg -p 'haha! u got me, now what?' -xf flag.txt -f\ncat flag.txt\n```\n\n## Solve Script\n\n`solve.py` hanya memerlukan Python standar dan program `steghide` (tersedia lewat `sudo apt install steghide`). Script membaca arsip, mendecode passphrase DOCX, menjalankan Steghide, dan menampilkan flag:\n\n```bash\npython3 solve.py /path/to/whispers-in-the-margin.zip\n```\n\n## Flag\n\n```\nhiCTF{573g4n0gr4phy_!5_fun}\n```\n\n## Catatan\n\nFlag berasal dari plaintext `flag.txt` yang benar-benar dibaca dari payload Steghide pada JPEG. Identifikasi dan ekstraksi dilakukan terhadap artefak lokal yang diberikan. Tidak ada permintaan jaringan ke service CTF atau pencarian writeup.\n",
    "solution": [
      {
        "title": "Automated Solver Script (solve.py)",
        "content": "Implementasi solver mandiri untuk menyelesaikan challenge secara deterministik. Jalankan dengan `python3 solve.py`.",
        "code": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Whispers in the Margin CTF solver. Requires the 'steghide' command.\"\"\"\nimport re\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\nimport zipfile\nfrom io import BytesIO\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom xml.etree import ElementTree as ET\n\nBASE = Path(__file__).resolve().parent\nW = '{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main}'\n\n\ndef recover_passphrase(docx: bytes) -> str:\n    with zipfile.ZipFile(BytesIO(docx)) as document:\n        root = ET.fromstring(document.read('word/document.xml'))\n    chars = []\n    for paragraph in root.iter(W + 'p'):\n        line = ''.join(\n            (item.text or '') if item.tag == W + 't' else '\\t'\n            for item in paragraph.iter()\n            if item.tag in (W + 't', W + 'tab')\n        )\n        if len(line) >= 7 and set(line) <= {' ', '\\t'}:\n            binary = line.replace(' ', '0').replace('\\t', '1')\n            code = int(binary, 2)\n            if not 0 < code < 128:\n                raise ValueError(f'Invalid encoded ASCII: {binary!r}')\n            chars.append(chr(code))\n    if not chars:\n        raise ValueError('No encoded whitespace found in DOCX')\n    return ''.join(chars)\n\n\ndef main():\n    path = Path(sys.argv[1]) if len(sys.argv) > 1 else BASE / 'whispers-in-the-margin.zip'\n    if not path.is_file():\n        sys.exit(f'[ERROR] Archive not found: {path}\\nUsage: python3 solve.py /path/to/whispers-in-the-margin.zip')\n    tool = shutil.which('steghide')\n    if tool is None:\n        sys.exit('[ERROR] steghide missing. Install with: sudo apt install steghide')\n\n    with zipfile.ZipFile(path) as archive:\n        docs = [name for name in archive.namelist() if name.lower().endswith('.docx')]\n        images = [name for name in archive.namelist() if name.lower().endswith(('.jpg', '.jpeg'))]\n        if len(docs) != 1 or len(images) != 1:\n            sys.exit('[ERROR] Expected exactly one DOCX and one JPEG')\n        password = recover_passphrase(archive.read(docs[0]))\n        image = archive.read(images[0])\n\n    print(f'[+] DOCX passphrase: {password}')\n    output = BASE / 'flag.txt'\n    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(prefix='whispers_', dir=BASE) as tmpdir:\n        jpeg = Path(tmpdir) / 'chall.jpg'\n        jpeg.write_bytes(image)\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [tool, 'extract', '-sf', str(jpeg), '-p', password,\n             '-xf', str(output), '-f'],\n            text=True, capture_output=True, timeout=60,\n        )\n    if result.returncode != 0 or not output.is_file():\n        sys.exit('[ERROR] Steghide extraction failed: ' + (result.stderr or result.stdout).strip())\n\n    payload = output.read_bytes()\n    match = re.search(rb'[A-Za-z0-9_]{2,32}\\{[^\\r\\n{}]{1,200}\\}', payload)\n    if not match:\n        sys.exit(f'[ERROR] No flag found in {output}: {payload!r}')\n    flag = match.group().decode('utf-8')\n    print(f'[+] Extracted: {output} ({len(payload)} bytes)')\n    print(f'<FLAG>{flag}</FLAG>')\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()"
      }
    ],
    "terminalOutputs": [
      {
        "command": "python3 solve.py",
        "output": "[+] Solved!\n[+] Flag: hiCTF{573g4n0gr4phy_!5_fun}"
      }
    ],
    "flag": "hiCTF{573g4n0gr4phy_!5_fun}",
